{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2615","id":4576002414,"node_id":"PR_kwDOACGs6c8AAAABEMBBbg","html_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2615","diff_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2615.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2615.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2615","number":2615,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Recognise Unicode variadic option placeholders","user":{"login":"znnnnnnn-wil","id":212858459,"node_id":"U_kgDODK_2Ww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212858459?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil","html_url":"https://github.com/znnnnnnn-wil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/znnnnnnn-wil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\r\n\r\nOption variadic detection used `\\w`, which only recognises ASCII word characters.\r\n\r\nAs a result, Unicode placeholders such as `--tag <值...>` were treated as non-variadic options, causing parsing of multiple values to fail with an excess-argument error.\r\n\r\nThe same issue also affects placeholders whose final identifier character is a Unicode combining mark or connector punctuation, such as decomposed names and the exact reproduction discussed in #2614.\r\n\r\nFixes #2614.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nUse the Unicode `ID_Continue` property to recognise valid identifier-continuation characters immediately before the variadic ellipsis.\r\n\r\nThis covers:\r\n\r\n- Unicode letters and numbers\r\n- Combining marks\r\n- Connector punctuation\r\n- Existing ASCII word characters\r\n\r\nThis preserves the existing behaviour for ASCII placeholders while continuing to reject non-variadic or malformed forms such as `<value,...>`, `<...>`, and `<value....>`.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\nAdded one regression test alongside the existing variadic special-case tests: a placeholder ending in a decomposed Unicode combining mark (`[cafe\\u0301...]`) is recognised as variadic.\r\n\r\nThe existing `[value,...]` test continues to verify that CSV-like single-argument placeholders are not treated as variadic. I also manually verified that the issue's `<值...>` example collects both values. On Node 22.19.0, the full suite passed (1,405 passed, 4 skipped), along with type, lint, and format checks.\r\n\r\n## ChangeLog\r\n\r\n- Support Unicode variadic option placeholders, including combining marks and connector punctuation.\r\n\r\nSome code and tests were assisted by Codex. I reviewed, understood, and tested the complete change and take responsibility for it.","created_at":"2026-09-19T05:36:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T06:24:36Z","closed_at":"2026-09-28T04:11:09Z","merged_at":"2026-09-28T04:11:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"a9f06ddfe1a97c932579370a1b4e727f7fa511a7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":1418520456,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE4NTIwNDU2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/labels/pending%20release","name":"pending release","color":"a7f9b6","default":false,"description":"Merged into a branch for a future release, but not released yet","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2615/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj